  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Equidistance teaching diagram: A and B reflected about given l, and given C on l connected to both. Retain the source segments only.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/5m/figures/fig-103.png",
      "sha256": "5e4f1f15068a24af235ea5aac169d440950026640c965978622f6f1d6d99e46d"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s3-n26",
        "text": "假定点$A$和点$B$关于直线$l$对称（图103）.在这条直线上取任意点$C$.线段$AC$和$CB$相互对称.这就是说，这两条线段合同，长度也相等.对称轴上每个点到关于这个轴对称的两点$A$与$B$的距离相等."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s3-n26",
        "text": "只有对称轴上的点才具有这种性质，这就是和两点$A,B$等距离的所有点都在这两点的对称轴上."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s3-n26",
        "text": "问题.作$A,B$两点的对称轴."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s3-n26",
        "text": "作与点$A,B$等距的点$C$和$D$（图104）.为此，分别以点$A,B$为圆心，以相同的半径作相交的两个圆周，过这两个圆周的交点$C,D$引直线.因为$|AC|=|BC|$，$|AD|=|BD|$，所以直线$CD$是$A,B$两点的对称轴."
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "source-single-frame",
        "description": "Actual PNG: three labelled marked points C at the common left junction, A upper right and B lower right; segments CA and CB, and one horizontal l through C. C lies on l; A/B reflect across l and CA=CB. Clean exact symmetric placement removes scan skew, not a new solution. No AB edge, midpoint dot, angle mark or tick is printed or added.",
